    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in the dark as an elemental soul. You have no memories or strength. Chaos, an indistinct guide, teaches you about intuition and what are energies and how to shape them at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You learn about the 12 Natures and the 3 realms where spirits, divines, and living coexist. You start your journey accompanied by an odd and useless Egyptian fennec.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You incarnate, travel through worlds, and influence human life. Soon enough you discover the mark of the biggest realms' threat ever. And it seems you were its first victim, interrupting your old plans... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stay immersed with our <strong>website</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an Elemental soul, you live among our mythologies that coexist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/0e500e747a5ff49e57ae73b5a384b261.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a soul and you are imbued with 12 different Natures, such as fire, water, time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/8af93c941ecdd763a0e0010131b60823.webp?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You evolve in the spiritual realms and travel to mystical places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/bcf7ed236e8a6e719a30b8113b4380c9.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a spirit, you'll love taking on the appearance of the living and inspiring dreamwalkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/c7ee63d6108b7db70af9b21abf428527.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can embody or take possession of a living creature in the physical worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/76be13009752ff1cb97ff6a0ef4b46a5.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest in your home and personalize it with items found in unexpected places and centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/fd3118b62c9237e059d7be362618fd28.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awake in the dark as an elemental soul. You have no memories or strength. Chaos, an indistinct guide, teaches you about intuition and what are energies and how to shape them at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You learn about the 12 Natures and the 3 realms where spirits, divines, and living coexist. You start your journey accompanied by an odd and useless Egyptian fennec.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You incarnate, travel through worlds, and influence human life. Soon enough you discover the mark of the biggest realms' threat ever. And it seems you were its first victim, interrupting your old plans... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stay immersed with our <strong>website</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an Elemental soul, you live among our mythologies that coexist </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/0e500e747a5ff49e57ae73b5a384b261.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a soul and you are imbued with 12 different Natures, such as fire, water, time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/8af93c941ecdd763a0e0010131b60823.webp?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You evolve in the spiritual realms and travel to mystical places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/bcf7ed236e8a6e719a30b8113b4380c9.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a spirit, you'll love taking on the appearance of the living and inspiring dreamwalkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/c7ee63d6108b7db70af9b21abf428527.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can embody or take possession of a living creature in the physical worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/76be13009752ff1cb97ff6a0ef4b46a5.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest in your home and personalize it with items found in unexpected places and centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065830/extras/fd3118b62c9237e059d7be362618fd28.avif?t=1754148908\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "A spiritual journey in the life of an elemental soul in our mythologies and legends. A unique adventure infused with 12 elements: fire, time, shadow, water... Unlock powerful spells and influence the game of other players. Fast travel through spirit realms, and try to survive in physical ones.",
